 multiplication, division, percentage calculations, sign toggle, backspace and clear.\n\nScientific Mode: Trigonometric functions (sin, cos, tan), logarithms (ln, log), square root, square, power, factorial, inverse, constants (\u03c0, e), and parentheses for complex expressions.\n\nBuilt for VR: Runs as a system panel alongside other apps, resizable window, hand tracking support, dark UI theme optimized for VR readability, high-precision math engine with 15-digit accuracy.\n\nCalcVR is free, fast, and distraction-free. No ads. No permissions. Just math.", "short_description": "A sleek, fast calculator for Meta Quest. Switch between Basic and Scientific modes instantly. Runs as a resizable system panel in your VR workspace."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://f1tt0n.github.io/calcvr-privacy/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Anwar Studio Official", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://f1tt0n.github.io/calcvr-privacy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25927063416974433"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1293823349289791"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1293823349289791"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1773173280, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1293823349289791